# A royal cape. Two layers: `cape` is the collar and gold clasp drawn in front of the duck,
# `cape-back` is the drape drawn behind the body (only what is outside the duck shows: a billow
# above the back, the fall behind the tail, the gold hem). Both frames share the neck anchor.
name: cape
size: 30x24
anchor: neck 26 11
palette:
  K #2a1f2d
  L #9a5ad0
  M #6e34a8
  N #4f2280
  Y #f2c230
  y #b8861a
  l #fff3a8

